        <h2 class="subhead1">Meetings</h2><p>The City Council meets generally twice per month (except during summer months). Formal meetings are held in the Municipal Courtroom at the Public Safety Complex, South Van Brunt Street and Englewood Avenue.</p><h2 class="subhead1">Agendas &amp; Minutes</h2><p><a href="https://www.cityofenglewood.org/AgendaCenter">View Most Recent Agendas and Minutes.</a></p><p>Minutes of all meetings are available at the office of the City Clerk.</p><h2 class="subhead1">Members</h2>
    </div>

